   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "- Normal path: route sends response; error handler is skipped.\n- Error path: next(err) or a thrown error skips normal middleware and jumps to process 4.\n- Process 4 is the ONLY place error responses are formatted (single point of control).\n- Unknown routes reach process 3, which creates an Error (statusCode 404) and calls next(err).",
   "originalText": "- Normal path: route sends response; error handler is skipped.\n- Error path: next(err) or a thrown error skips normal middleware and jumps to process 4.\n- Process 4 is the ONLY place error responses are formatted (single point of control).\n- Unknown routes reach process 3, which creates an Error (statusCode 404) and calls next(err).",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
